## Fantasy Elements

### The Other World
- Has different physical laws where magic works naturally
- Creatures evolved where "armor class" is real physical property
- Dragons aren't just big lizards - they're impossibly magical, don't interact with kinetic energy the same way
- Conventional weapons work but with diminishing returns against truly magical targets

### Fantasy Races (TBD specifics)
- Orcs: Strong, tough, tribal warfare background, developing with modern weapons
- Dragons: Legitimate air superiority threats, near-impossible to kill with conventional weapons
- Various other races dealing with sudden technological shock
- All trying to understand "human magic" (technology)

### Magic Users in Tech World
- Wizards trying to understand radio, computers as if they're unfamiliar magic
- Can feel energy moving but can't see the "spirits" or "incantations"
- Some learning to sense/manipulate data transmission through mystical means
- Accidentally creating viruses through curses on laptops
- Learning to "counterspell" radio transmissions

